       fhir:ElementDefinition.path [ fhir:value "Location.address.state" ] ;
       fhir:ElementDefinition.definition [ fhir:value "Name of the norwegian \"fylke\"). If fylkes-number is required \"eiendomsinformasjon\" should be used with koded kommune-number.\r\n\r\nSub-unit of a country with limited sovereignty in a federally organized country. A code may be used if codes are in common use (i.e. US 2 letter state codes).\r\n\r\nLocation : dipscoredb.dwkodeverkverdier Langtnavn\r\nWard : dipscoredb.dwkodeverkverdier Langtnavn" ]
